'''La Serranía''' ({{Literal translation|the mountains}}) is one of ten [[Regions of Balisca|regions]] of [[Hesperia]], within the [[Baliscan Confederation]]. It is bordered by [[Cassiná]] to the north, the [[Aethiopian Ocean]] to the east, [[Guarapiranga]] to the south, and [[Baxu Trás-as-Montanyas]] to the west. It has an area of {{convert|18862.86|km2|abbr=on}}, and a population of 1,988,095 in the [[2025 Baliscan census]]. The capital and largest city of Las Serras is [[Bona Aria]]. 

